<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Anchor Gaming as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Anchor Gaming as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it initiated Anchor Gaming as buy.</p>
<p>-- set 12- to 18-month price target of $79. Shares rose 5/8 to 62-1/4.</p>
</text>
